What this covers
----------------

The kit's art is code: the shapes, colours, poses and sounds it draws and plays.
"The kits' art, sounds and music" means:

- packages/sahne-kit/src/ (people's parts, faces, hair, clothes, hands,
  gestures, palettes and patterns; the set pieces and props of src/set/; the
  animal puppets of src/puppets/; the synthesized sounds of src/sounds.ts and
  the music of src/music.ts), except what is reserved below;
- the sound files cut from recordings, packages/sahne-kit/sounds/*.m4a. The
  recordings they are cut from are CC0 (public domain), from the sources listed
  in packages/sahne-kit/sounds/SOURCES.md, and stay CC0;
- the pictures made from them in this repository: the golden frames
  (packages/sahne-gallery/golden/), apart from what they show of the reserved
  works.

The build scripts and tests that sit beside the art (packages/sahne-kit/*/build.ts,
packages/sahne-kit/test/) and the rest of the repository are code under the MIT
License (LICENSE).

